        "sentence": "Passive USB 1.1 packet sniffer using the RP2040 PIO coprocessor.",
        "paragraph": "Captures Low-Speed (1.5 Mbps) and Full-Speed (12 Mbps) USB packets passively through high-impedance GPIO tapping. Uses a 22-instruction PIO hardware 8x DPLL for clock recovery, zero-gap 2-channel hardware DMA ping-pong buffering, and an SRAM-resident -O3 decoder implementing inline NRZI decoding, bit-unstuffing, packet framing, and table-accelerated CRC5/CRC16 verification. Delivers structured USBPacket objects through a callback API. Dual-core ready. Ideal for protocol analysis, HID device monitoring, and USB debugging.",
